# Scratch captures. The screenshot harnesses write review runs under the atlas directory; a run named
# `tmp` (or anything under it) is working material, never a committed asset — 100 of them were swept in
# by a `git add -A` once. The approved comparison boards live in docs/atlas/presentation/compare/ and in
# the named before/after directories, which are NOT ignored.
docs/atlas/presentation/tmp/
docs/atlas/**/_scratch/
